00:04:23.624 --> 00:04:30.824
<v Host>Lacquer was applied to the walls and pillars, and craftspeople have carried on the fine carving and coloring work.

00:04:31.423 --> 00:04:33.800
<v Vocab>職人

00:04:34.199 --> 00:04:36.863
<v Host>It means a craftsman or artisan.

00:04:37.463 --> 00:04:52.223
<v Slow>今回の復元のテーマは「見せる復興」で、工事の間も、観光客は見学エリアから作業の様子を見ることができました。

00:04:53.024 --> 00:05:01.543
<v Host>The theme of this restoration is a recovery people can watch — even during construction, tourists could see the work from a viewing area.

00:05:02.144 --> 00:05:04.543
<v Vocab>復興

00:05:04.944 --> 00:05:08.735
<v Host>It means recovery or reconstruction after a disaster.

00:05:09.336 --> 00:05:25.079
<v Slow>完成式は11月22日に首里城公園で行われ、次の日の祝日から、予約をした人が正殿の中に入れるようになります。

00:05:25.879 --> 00:05:35.240
<v Host>The completion ceremony will be held on November twenty-second, and from the national holiday the next day, people with reservations can go inside.

00:05:35.839 --> 00:05:38.120
<v Vocab>予約

00:05:38.519 --> 00:05:41.255
<v Host>It means a reservation or booking.

00:05:41.855 --> 00:05:53.160
<v Slow>沖縄の人々は、首里城がもう一度美しい姿を見せてくれる日を、楽しみに待っています。

00:05:53.959 --> 00:06:00.199
<v Host>The people of Okinawa are looking forward to the day the castle shows its beautiful form once again.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.103
<v Vocab>姿

00:06:03.504 --> 00:06:05.951
<v Host>It means a figure or appearance.

00:06:06.552 --> 00:06:09.552
